//! # Infernum-Sigil
//!
//! *"The infernal gateway to synthetic intelligence"*
//!
//! Complete LLM inference framework ported from Rust to Sigil,
//! demonstrating the expressive power and code reduction capabilities
//! of the Sigil language.
//!
//! ## Modules
//!
//! - **core**: Types, errors, requests, responses, streaming
//! - **abaddon**: Inference engine, models, backends, caching
//! - **malphas**: Request routing and model orchestration
//! - **astaroth**: A/B testing and experimentation framework
//! - **stolas**: RAG, embeddings, vector storage
//! - **beleth**: Agent framework, tools, planning, memory
//! - **asmodeus**: Fine-tuning, LoRA, training loops
//! - **dantalion**: Observability, metrics, tracing
//! - **server**: OpenAI-compatible HTTP API server
//! - **grimoire_loader**: Persona/prompt management
//! - **vision**: Multimodal vision encoders, ViT, VLM
//! - **diffusion**: Image generation, SD, SDXL, SD3, Flux
//! - **video**: Video generation, SVD, AnimateDiff, CogVideoX
//! - **optimization**: Flash attention, quantization, caching
//! - **bench**: Comprehensive benchmark suite
//! - **native**: Zero-overhead C++/CUDA FFI bindings, multi-GPU distributed inference
//! - **compat**: PyTorch, diffusers, SafeTensors, GGUF, ONNX compatibility
//! - **presets**: Quality presets for maximum fidelity (Draft/Standard/High/Ultra/Cinematic)
//!
//! ### Agent Infrastructure (Sigil-lang 0.2.1)
//!
//! - **aegis**: Security and safety guardrails (content filtering, trust boundaries, rate limiting)
//! - **anima**: Consciousness modeling (self-model, affect, attention, metacognition)
//! - **commune**: Multi-agent communication (channels, consensus, negotiation)
//! - **gnosis**: Knowledge management (knowledge graphs, ontologies, inference)
//! - **engram**: Memory systems (working memory, episodic, semantic, consolidation)
//! - **omen**: Prediction and forecasting (time series, probability, trends)
//! - **oracle**: Query/answer systems (query planning, answer synthesis)
//! - **daemon**: Background processes (scheduling, monitoring, health checks)
//! - **covenant**: Contract systems (Design by Contract, SLAs, verification)
//!
//! ### Language Extensions
//!
//! - **actor**: Actor model concurrency (supervision, mailboxes, pools)
//! - **saga**: Distributed transactions (compensation, orchestration)
//! - **autodiff**: Automatic differentiation (forward/reverse mode, tape-based)
//! - **rune**: Pattern matching (structural patterns, guards, active patterns)
//!
//! ## Statistics
//!
//! Total Sigil LOC: ~85,000
//! 31 modules covering LLM, vision, diffusion, video, agents
//! Full PyTorch/HuggingFace ecosystem compatibility
//! Maximum quality: 8K images, 4K video with cinematic color grading
//! Complete Sigil-lang 0.2.1 agent infrastructure implementation

